<title>FINLAND: ROCLA SAYS TO DELIVER TRUCKS WORTH 6.5 MLN MARKKA.</title>
<headline>ROCLA SAYS TO DELIVER TRUCKS WORTH 6.5 MLN MARKKA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish warehouse truck maker Rocla Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it would deliver trucks worth 6.5 million markka to Dutch supermarket chain EDAH Supermarkten B.V.  </p>
<p>Rocla said the deal was the biggest single one so far in the current financial period.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
</text>
